message: >-
  If you use OpenLain5G 1.1.0, cite the software metadata in this file.
  No journal article or archival DOI is associated with this source release.
title: "OpenLain5G"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
authors:
  - family-names: "Canazas Rosas"
    given-names: "Willian Roy"
    affiliation: "National University of San Agustin of Arequipa"
  - family-names: "Prieto Tito"
    given-names: "Manuel Ismael"
    affiliation: "National University of San Agustin of Arequipa"
  - family-names: "Tamo Calla"
