abstract: >-
  OpenLain5G is a reproducible research environment for deploying, managing,
  and validating integrated laboratory 4G LTE/VoLTE and 5G SA/VoNR networks,
  plus an experimental 5G NSA profile. It integrates existing open-source
  components with configuration, orchestration, validation, run traceability,
  RF safeguards, and a FastAPI/React interface.
repository-code: "https://github.com/guallycanazas/Lain5G"
url: "https://github.com/guallycanazas/Lain5G"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "4G LTE"
  - "5G"
  - "IMS"
  - "VoLTE"
  - "VoNR"
  - "network experimentation"
  - "reproducibility"
